格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH Web GUI plugin: OpenCodeGo quota breathing light + liquid-glass panel with rolling/weekly/monthly progress bars (作者 Xu Yuanshan)","id":"gh:1334352273","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-opencodego-usage","slug":"BeiZi6/dsh-opencodego-usage","topics":["ai-agent","coding-agent","deepseek","dsh-plugin","javascript","llm","plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH Web GUI plugin: OpenCodeGo quota breathing light + liquid-glass panel with rolling/weekly/monthl"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"y progress bars (作者 Xu Yuanshan)"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-opencodego-usage"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**English · 简体中文**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"OpenCodeGo quota monitor for the DeepSeek Harness (DSH) Web GUI: a breathing indicator at the bottom"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"-right of the input box shows your remaining quota at a glance; click it to open a liquid-glass pane"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"l with per-window progress bars and reset times."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- 🟢🟡🔴 **Breathing indicator** — color-coded by remaining quota (>50% green, 20–50% yellow, <20% red)"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" with a gentle 3.6 s breathing animation\n- 📊 **Three-window progress panel** — `rolling` (≈ last 5 h"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"), `weekly` (≈ last 7 d) and `monthly` (≈ last 30 d) bars with used · remaining amounts and a reset "},{"id":"p6s4","text":"time for each window\n- 🔑 **Zero-config key handling** — reads your API key from DSH credentials auto"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"matically (only when the provider is `opencode-go`); an in-panel override is available\n- 🪟 **Liquid-"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"glass panel** — mouse-follow highlight, frosted blur and a window-style diagonal open animation\n- ⏱ "},{"id":"p6s7","text":"**Auto-refresh** — fetches fresh quota every 2 minutes"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Requires DeepSeek Harness with the web profile enabled. Install from the official registry:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Restart `dsh web` for the plugin to take effect."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"To remove:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- The indicator sits at the bottom-right of the conversation input; its color reflects the lowest re"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"maining share across the three windows:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Remaining share | Color |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| > 50% | 🟢 green |\n| 20–50% | 🟡 yellow |\n| < 20% | 🔴 red |\n- Click it to expand the panel:\n- `rolli"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ng` — quota used in roughly the last 5 hours\n- `weekly` — quota used in roughly the last 7 days\n- `m"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"onthly` — quota used in roughly the last 30 days\n- Each window shows the used percentage, the remain"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"ing share and the exact reset time.\n- A manual API key override can be entered in the panel for the "},{"id":"p16s5","text":"current session; clearing it falls back to automatic resolution.\n- Data refreshes automatically ever"},{"id":"p16s6","text":"ion; clearing it falls back to automatic resolution.\n- Data refreshes automatically every 2 minutes."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### API key resolution"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The plugin looks for a key in this order:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"1. Manual override entered in the panel (kept in a small state file under `$DSH_HOME`; the path can "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"be moved with the `OCG_STATE_PATH` environment variable)\n2. DSH credentials — only when the active p"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"rovider is `opencode-go`, the credential referenced by `llm-pi-ai.providers.opencode-go.apiKeyEnv` i"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"s resolved\n3. Process environment\n4. The state file"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"The key is only ever sent to the official OpenCodeGo quota endpoint over HTTPS."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- **Host half** (`index.js`) — registers a same-origin route `/opencodego-usage` on the DSH web serv"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"er. The route queries the official OpenCodeGo quota API (`GET https://opencode.ai/zen/go/v1/usage`, "},{"id":"p22s3","text":"Bearer auth) and parses the window data:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Older `used` / `limit` numeric pair shapes are tolerated as well.\n- **Client half** (`client.js`) — "},{"id":"p24s2","text":"a web-shell module registered into the `conversation.input.right` slot; it polls the same-origin rou"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"te every 2 minutes and renders the indicator and the panel."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Known limitations"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- The state file only stores a manually overridden key; deleting it never affects credential-based r"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"esolution.\n- Quota values and reset times are reported by the OpenCodeGo API as-is — no local estima"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"tion.\n- Quota values and reset times are reported by the OpenCodeGo API as-is — no local estimation."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness Web GUI (`dsh web`)\n- Node.js >= 22.19\n- Peer dependencies: `@deepseek-ai/cordis`"},{"id":"p28s2","text":" (^4), `@deepseek-ai/dsh-host-webserver` (^0.1.0-rc.6)"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"MIT © Xu Yuanshan"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Links"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"- Repository: <https://github.com/BeiZi6/dsh-opencodego-usage>\n- Issues: <https://github.com/BeiZi6/"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"dsh-opencodego-usage/issues>"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## 中文简介"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"为 DSH Web GUI 打造的 OpenCodeGo 剩余额度监控插件:输入框右下角呼吸灯(>50% 绿 / 20–50% 黄 / <20% 红,3.6 秒慢呼吸),点击展开液态玻璃面板——近 5"},{"id":"p34s2","text":" 小时 / 近 7 天 / 近 30 天三窗口进度条与重置时间,每 2 分钟自动刷新;API Key 自动读取 DSH 凭据(仅限 opencode-go 提供商),也可在面板内手动覆盖。"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
